{%- comment -%}
  TALLOW PDP V2, REFORMULATED, 2026-07-21. Separate file from tallow-pdp.liquid
  on purpose, that file stays live for the current B30 batch (its ad copy is
  built around the CURRENT formula: whipped, manuka honey, calendula, 120g).
  This is a draft/preview page for the reformulated product (new supplier,
  denser but still soft texture, raw honey not manuka, essential oils not
  calendula, 60g not 120g), NOT yet wired to live traffic. Do not point any
  running ad at this page until the founder confirms the switch and existing
  ad copy across the account is reconciled with the new ingredient list,
  otherwise every ad claiming "manuka honey" / "calendula" / "whipped" /
  "120g" becomes inaccurate the moment this goes live.

  TALLOW PDP · custom Online Store 2.0 product section (Shrine Pro compatible)
  Real Shopify product forms → the Add to Cart buttons actually add to cart.
  All CSS is scoped under #tallow-pdp-v2 so it will NOT collide with the theme.
  Dynamic: title, price, compare-at, gallery images, variant id, ATC, availability.
  Marketing copy (diagrams/checks/stats) is editable via section settings in the
  theme customizer where exposed; the rest is inline and editable here in code.

  PRICING NOTE, UPDATED 2026-07-19: the displayed price is HARDCODED via section
  settings (price_compare struck through + price_sale), NOT pulled from the
  variant's price/compare-at, so the PDP badge can say whatever it wants
  regardless of the real product price.

  Real product price is a FLAT $49.99, no automatic "-$20 Sale" discount on the
  balm anymore. That two-automatic-product-discount setup (Sale on the balm +
  the free-gift Buy X Get Y on the lip mask) was tried and broke: even with
  "combine with product discounts" checked on both, Shopify would silently
  drop the BXGY discount at checkout, the lip mask kept ringing up at full
  price. Root cause not fully confirmed (suspected: two automatic
  product-scoped discounts don't reliably stack even when marked combinable),
  but the fix was simple and durable: set the balm's real Shopify price to a
  flat $49.99 and delete the Sale discount entirely. Only the Buy X Get Y
  free-gift discount remains, one automatic product discount, zero conflict.
  DO NOT reintroduce a second automatic product-level discount on the balm
  without testing full checkout end-to-end first, this exact combo is what
  broke.

  SPEED: ZERO web fonts (system stack: system sans body, Georgia headings) = no
  font download/render-block. Hero image fetchpriority high + eager; below-fold lazy.
  One section, inline scoped CSS, SVG icon sprite (no emoji, no icon font),
  content-visibility:auto on below-fold sections.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}

<div id="tallow-pdp-v2">

<style>
  #tallow-pdp-v2{
    --cream:#F6F1E9;--cream-2:#EFE7DA;--ink:#23291F;
    --green:#2E4731;--green-deep:#22351F;--amber:#C98A3C;--amber-soft:#E9C892;
    --line:#D8CDBC;--red:#B14A36;--paper:#FBF8F2;--grey:#6b6552;
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);background:var(--cream);line-height:1.5;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  #tallow-pdp-v2 *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 h1,#tallow-pdp-v2 h2,#tallow-pdp-v2 h3,#tallow-pdp-v2 .serif{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.1}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .wrap{width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--amber)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .icon{width:1em;height:1em;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:14px;padding:17px 26px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;width:100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .btn:active{background:var(--green-deep)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .btn[disabled]{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .stars{color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:1px;font-size:14px;line-height:1}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .pf{margin:0}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .anno{background:var(--green-deep);color:#F2EAD9;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:500}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .anno b{color:var(--amber-soft)}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:45;background:var(--cream);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:11px;padding-bottom:11px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-nav .word{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-nav .word span{color:var(--amber)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .cart-link{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;padding:2px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .cart-link .icon{width:25px;height:25px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .cart-badge{position:absolute;top:-5px;right:-7px;min-width:17px;height:17px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:1}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .cart-badge[hidden]{display:none}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .hero{padding:18px 0 26px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .gallery .main{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#EFE6D6,#E3D4BC);border-radius:18px;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .gallery .main img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .badge{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;background:var(--amber);color:#fff;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;z-index:2}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .thumbs{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:10px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .thumb{flex:1;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .buy{padding-top:22px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .rating-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .rating-row a{font-size:13px;color:var(--grey);text-decoration:underline}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .buy h1{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:6px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .subt{font-size:13px;color:var(--grey);margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:600}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .price .now{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:600}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .price .was{font-size:17px;color:#9a927d;text-decoration:line-through}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .price .save{background:var(--amber-soft);color:#6a481a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .ship{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey);margin-bottom:16px}
  @keyframes fgReveal{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-bundle{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin:16px 0 14px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;width:100%;padding:14px 14px 14px 13px;border:1.5px solid #ddd6c6;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;color:inherit;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier:hover{border-color:#c9bda4}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #6a481a;outline-offset:2px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier[disabled]{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier.is-on{border-color:#6a481a;border-width:2px;padding:13px 13px 13px 12px;background:var(--amber-soft,#fdf6ea)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-main{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-radio{flex:0 0 auto;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #c4baa6;background:#fff;position:relative}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier.is-on .tlw-tier-radio{border-color:#6a481a;border-width:2px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier.is-on .tlw-tier-radio::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:3px;border-radius:50%;background:#6a481a}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-body{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-name{font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.2}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey,#8a8272)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-prices{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:1px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-now{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.15}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-was{font-size:12.5px;color:#9a927d;text-decoration:line-through}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-each{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--grey,#8a8272)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-badge{position:absolute;top:-9px;right:12px;background:#6a481a;color:#fff;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;z-index:1}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier--best{margin-top:4px}

  /* gift stack: only visible on the selected tier, so choosing reveals the value */
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gifts{display:none}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier.is-on .tlw-gifts{display:block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6dfcd}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gifts-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gifts-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6a481a}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gifts-total{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;background:#6a481a;color:#fff;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gifts-row{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:1fr;gap:7px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;padding:8px 5px;border:1px solid #ece5d5;border-radius:7px;background:#fdfbf6}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-vis{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;margin-bottom:1px;color:#6a481a}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-vis svg{width:24px;height:24px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-vis img{width:34px;height:34px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:4px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-tag{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.03em;color:#fff;background:#7a9a5b;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-tag s{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;opacity:.85;margin-left:1px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-name{font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;color:#5a5344;font-weight:600}
  @media (max-width:400px){
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gifts-row{gap:5px}
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift{padding:7px 3px}
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-vis{width:28px;height:28px}
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-vis svg{width:20px;height:20px}
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-vis img{width:28px;height:28px}
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-name{font-size:10px}
    #tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-gift-tag{font-size:9px;padding:2px 4px}
  }
  @media (max-width:380px){#tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier{padding:12px 11px}#tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-name{font-size:14.5px}#tallow-pdp-v2 .tlw-tier-now{font-size:17.5px}}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .free-gift-card{
    position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg,var(--paper) 0%,var(--amber-soft) 145%);
    border:1px solid var(--amber);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 16px 14px 14px;
    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(107,72,26,.10);overflow:hidden;
    animation:fgReveal .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1) .15s both;
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#tallow-pdp-v2 .free-gift-card{animation:none}}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-ribbon{
    position:absolute;top:-1px;left:16px;
    background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;
    font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:3px 10px 4px;border-radius:0 0 7px 7px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  }
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-media{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;
    flex-shrink:0;margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    border:1px solid rgba(201,138,60,.35);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-icon{width:28px;height:28px;color:var(--amber)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-stub{align-self:stretch;width:0;border-left:1.5px dashed rgba(107,72,26,.28);position:relative;flex-shrink:0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-stub::before,#tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-stub::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:-6px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cream)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-stub::before{top:-14px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-stub::after{bottom:-14px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-text{min-width:0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-eyebrow{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8a6a2e}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-title{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.22}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:6px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .fg-auto{font-size:11.5px;color:#7a6a4e}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .gift-line{margin-top:9px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey);text-align:center}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .micro{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:15px 0 0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .micro span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#46503c}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .micro .icon{width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--green)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .guar-inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:#5c5848;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .guar-inline .ic{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .guar-inline .ic .icon{width:17px;height:17px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .trust-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:6px;margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .trust-strip div{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5c5848;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:5px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .trust-strip .icon{width:21px;height:21px;color:var(--green)}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 section.band{padding:46px 0;content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 600px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .center{text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 h2.sec{font-size:27px;margin-bottom:8px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .mt{margin-top:24px}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;max-width:840px;margin:0 auto}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 15px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .check .icon{width:19px;height:19px;color:var(--green)}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .diagram-band{background:var(--green-deep);color:#F2EAD9}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .diagram-band .eyebrow{color:var(--amber-soft)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .diagram-band h2{color:#fff}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .diagram{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:840px;margin:24px auto 0;background:var(--paper);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;color:var(--ink)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dcol{padding:22px 20px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dcol+.dcol{border-top:2px dashed var(--line)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dcol h4{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:14px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dcol.bad h4{color:var(--red)}#tallow-pdp-v2 .dcol.good h4{color:var(--green)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .surface{height:2px;background:var(--ink);margin:12px 0}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .mol{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:5px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .mol b{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .bad .mol b{background:var(--red)}#tallow-pdp-v2 .good .mol b{background:var(--green)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .arr{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:5px}#tallow-pdp-v2 .arr.up{color:var(--red)}#tallow-pdp-v2 .arr.dn{color:var(--green)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dnote{font-size:13px;margin-top:9px;font-weight:500;color:#46503c}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dnote.bad{color:var(--red)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .dbottom{max-width:840px;margin:16px auto 0;text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:18px;color:#fff}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .math{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;align-items:center}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .math .side{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;text-align:center}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .math .big{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:52px;font-weight:700;line-height:1}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .math .bad .big{color:var(--red)}#tallow-pdp-v2 .math .good .big{color:var(--green)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .math .lbl{font-size:13px;color:var(--grey);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .math .to{font-size:24px;color:var(--amber);text-align:center}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .labels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .label-card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .label-card h4{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:12px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .label-card.bad h4{color:var(--red)}#tallow-pdp-v2 .label-card.good h4{color:var(--green)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .ing{font-size:13.5px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);color:#5c5848}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .ing.first{font-weight:700;color:var(--red)}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .ing.g{color:var(--green-deep);font-weight:600}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .ing.more{color:#9a927d;font-style:italic;border:none}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .stat{text-align:center;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .stat .n{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);line-height:1}
  #tallow-pdp-v2 .stat .t{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--grey);font-weight:500;margin-top:5px}

  #tallow-pdp-v2 .ba{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px}
